<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in Arizona</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets across Arizona — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers from the Valley of the Sun down to Tucson, backed by 23+ years of in-market experience.</p></div>
